 Use just the services if you want hands-off management. Mix and match. Both are available separately."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does repricing work? Do I need complex rules?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Our Buy Box repricing strategy is simple and customizable. Get started repricing in 60 seconds. Advanced rules are optional."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is my inventory data safe? Can I export it anytime?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You own your data. Export inventory, orders, and metrics anytime you want in standard formats."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I want to cancel? How long is the commitment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Month-to-month. Cancel anytime with no penalty. No long-term contracts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you integrate with my 3PL or warehouse partner?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We integrate with most major 3PLs and WMS systems. Tell us who you use, and we'll make sure the connection works."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I start free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. 14-day trial with full software access. Credit card required."}}]}</script><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20 text-center"><nav class="mb-8 text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-normal text-left" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="hover:text-neutral-500" href="../index.html">Home</a><span class="mx-1.5">›</span><span class="text-neutral-600">Software</span></nav><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-900 via-[#556FE6] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text text-transparent" style="opacity:1;transform:none">Seller Software for Amazon, Walmart &amp; Beyond</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-neutral-500" style="opacity:1;transform:none">One Platform for Sourcing, Repricing, Inventory &amp; Orders</p><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:none">Most sellers use between five and twelve different tools to run their Amazon and Walmart businesses. You&#x27;re paying for separate subscriptions to scan for products, monitor competition, manage inventory across channels, reprice automatically, process orders, and track shipping. Ecom Circles replaces all of that. One platform. One login. One monthly bill.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a href="#features" class="gradient-bg shadow-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white transition hover:opacity-90">Get Started Free<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-neutral-700 transition hover:border-[#556FE6] hover:text-[#556FE6]" href="../pricing/index.html">View Pricing</a></div></div></section><section id="features" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Your Complete Toolkit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Six tools, one dashboard. Built to work together seamlessly.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="sourcing/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Sourcing</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Find profitable products across Amazon, Walmart, and wholesale suppliers without scanning competitor inventory manually. Works with nearly any supplier.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="repricer/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Repricer</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Win the Buy Box on Amazon and Walmart while protecting your margins. Repricing rules start in 60 seconds.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="inventory-management/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Inventory Management</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Track stock, COGS, and pricing across every account. Bulk edit, set min/max alerts, enforce MAP pricing, and sync inventory automatically.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="order-management/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-cart h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="21" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1"></circle><path d="M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Order Management</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Process orders from Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl in one place. Buy shipping labels, track fulfillment, and manage returns without juggling multiple dashboards.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="extension/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M17 20v2"></path><path d="M17 2v2"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M2 17h2"></path><path d="M2 7h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="M20 17h2"></path><path d="M20 7h2"></path><path d="M7 20v2"></path><path d="M7 2v2"></path><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Browser Extension</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Research products, check price history, estimate sales, and manage your catalog directly from Amazon and Walmart pages.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><a href="wfs-calculator/index.html"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer h-full"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#6172F3]/10 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">WFS Calculator</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Know exactly which fulfillment method (FBA, FBM, Walmart fulfillment) maximizes your profit for each SKU before you commit inventory.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#556FE6] font-semibold hover:underline">Learn More →</p></div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8">Why Sellers Choose Ecom Circles</h2><div class="space-y-8"><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Tools That Work Together</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Sourcing + Repricer + Inventory are connected. When you source a product, your inventory and repricer automatically know about it. When inventory levels change, repricing adjusts instantly.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Multi-Marketplace from Day One</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl all work in the same system. You don&#x27;t have to learn six different platforms or manage separate subscriptions.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Warehouse Integration</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">We run fulfillment centers in the Chicago area. Prep your inventory, dropship, or manage returns all through the same platform.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Services When You Need Them</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">DIY software is great. But if you want managed services (account management, account buying, warehouse prep, or suspension reinstatement), access them all here.</p></div></div><div class="mt-10 space-y-4 pt-10 border-t border-neutral-200"><p class="text-neutral-600">Want hands-off management? <a class="font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../services/amazon-management/index.html">See what management looks like</a> or explore <a class="font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../services/walmart-management/index.html">Walmart management services</a>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-6">Why Disconnected Tools Stop Working at Scale</h2><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">Best-of-breed tooling worked when Amazon was the only marketplace that mattered. Today, sellers run inventory across Amazon, Walmart, and increasingly Mirakl. When your scanner, repricer, inventory, and orders live in separate systems, three predictable failures show up.</p><div class="space-y-10"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">1. Data Silos</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Your scanner finds a product on a wholesale list. You manually enter it into your repricer. You upload it to inventory management. You check Walmart restrictions in a separate tool. Then you realize your pricing data hasn&#x27;t synced back to the scanner. Now you&#x27;re back in the repricer making manual edits. This workflow happens dozens of times per day, and every handoff is a chance to introduce a typo or skip a step.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">2. Repricing Lag</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Your sourcing tells you a product is available at one cost. Your repricer thinks it should sell at another. But your repricer doesn&#x27;t know what just arrived in inventory, and it doesn&#x27;t know what the current Buy Box looks like on the other channel you sell on. Hours later you realize you&#x27;ve been pricing without the latest competitive landscape. You adjust manually. The cycle repeats every time inventory or competition shifts.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">3. Marketplace Alignment Failures</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You set repricing rules on Amazon to target the Buy Box. You set different rules on Walmart because the fee structure and competitive dynamics are different. Your inventory tool doesn&#x27;t know which rules apply where. When stock levels shift, repricing on one channel can outrun availability on the other. You wake up to suppressed listings because the system oversold against a phantom number.</p></div></div><p class="mt-10 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Ecom Circles fixes the root cause: sourcing, repricer, inventory, and orders share the same data, so changes in one place show up everywhere they need to.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-900 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#556FE6] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text">$1.7B+</div><p class="mt-2 text-white/70">In seller sales volume managed</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#556FE6] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text">1.29M+</div><p class="mt-2 text-white/70">Orders processed</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#556FE6] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text">5.15M+</div><p class="mt-2 text-white/70">Listings actively managed</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#556FE6] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text">7,174+</div><p class="mt-2 text-white/70">Sellers and teams</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">What Every Plan Includes</h2><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Every paid plan gives you the full suite. Nothing here is locked behind a higher tier. Plans differ only on volume and team size, and those numbers live in one place: the pricing page.</p></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8 md:p-10" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3"><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Product scanner and sourcing lists</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Repricer for Amazon and Walmart</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Inventory and stock management</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Order management and fulfillment</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Profit tracking and reporting</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Full browser extension suite</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>Supplier price and stock monitoring</span></li><li class="text-neutral-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-[#556FE6] mt-1">✓</span><span>14-day free trial on every paid plan</span></li></ul></div><div class="mt-10 text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Annual billing saves two months on every plan. Every paid plan starts with a 14-day free trial; credit card required.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 px-6 py-3 text-base font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-neutral-800" href="../pricing/index.html">See full pricing breakdown<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><div class="text-center mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Platforms We Support</h2><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Built for sellers operating across multiple marketplaces, not bolted on after the fact.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Live Now</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2"><li class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-900">Amazon (FBA + FBM)</li><li class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-900">Walmart (WFS + Merchant Fulfilled)</li></ul></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Coming Soon</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2"><li class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-900">Mirakl</li></ul></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wide">On the 2026 Roadmap</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2"><li class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-900">Shopify</li><li class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-900">eBay</li></ul></div></div><div class="mt-10 text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Scale plan customers get API access for custom integrations with your 3PL, WMS, or ERP. <a class="font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../contact/index.html">Talk to us about your stack</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="text-center mb-14" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">How Sellers Use Ecom Circles</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Retail &amp; Online Arbitrage</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Source products from clearance and online deals. Reprice automatically to stay competitive. Warehouse prep in Chicago. One platform manages everything from sourcing to cash out.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Wholesale Sellers</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Bulk-import wholesale catalogs. Reprice based on Walmart or Amazon margins. Track inventory across multiple suppliers. Manage fulfillment through our warehouse.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Growing Teams</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">One login per team member. Assign permissions, track inventory, manage orders. No more Slack threads asking who updated listings.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Multi-Channel Operators</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Run Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl from one dashboard. Sync inventory automatically. One sourcing pipeline feeds all channels.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><div class="text-center mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">What a Day Looks Like</h2><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">How the platform shows up in your actual workflow, depending on how you sell.</p></div><div class="space-y-10"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Retail and online arbitrage</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You find clearance items at Target, Walmart, or online. Upload your list to the scanner. Restrictions and rough margins get checked in bulk. You add the profitable ones to inventory; repricing rules apply automatically. As products sell, inventory updates and low-stock alerts fire. If you use our warehouse, you ship the box to us and inventory reflects receipt without a manual step. The whole loop, from clearance rack to cash out, happens in one place.</p></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Wholesale sellers</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You work with a handful of suppliers and import monthly catalogs of hundreds or thousands of SKUs. Upload the catalog; the scanner matches against Amazon and Walmart simultaneously, flags restrictions, and shows margin given marketplace fees. Filter to what&#x27;s profitable. Each channel reprices independently based on its own competitive landscape, so Amazon and Walmart can run different rules without stepping on each other. Restock alerts fire from sales velocity. Bulk editing handles pricing changes across both channels in one pass.</p></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Growing teams</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You&#x27;ve hired a VA or an account manager and the &quot;who did what&quot; questions are piling up in Slack. Each team member gets their own login with assignable permissions. Your VA uploads through the sourcing hub and sees products flow into inventory and repricing. Your account manager owns repricing rules and sees the impact on inventory in real numbers. You get a single view of accounts, orders, and activity - no more reconstructing the day&#x27;s changes from chat history.</p></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Multi-channel operators</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Inventory is spread across Amazon, Walmart, and (soon) Mirakl. Sourcing feeds all channels from one pipeline. Repricer runs Amazon and Walmart natively, with<!-- --> <a class="font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="repricer/mirakl/index.html">Mirakl repricing</a> <!-- -->coming. Orders from every channel land in one inbox, with the right fulfillment route applied per source: Amazon goes to FBA, Walmart goes to WFS, dropship orders route to your 3PL. The whole thing operates as one system, not five tools pretending to be one.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 text-center mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Common Questions</h2><div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">Can I use Ecom Circles if I sell on just one channel?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">Do I need the software AND the managed services?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">How does repricing work? Do I need complex rules?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">Is my inventory data safe? Can I export it anytime?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">What if I want to cancel? How long is the commitment?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">Do you integrate with my 3PL or warehouse partner?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="border-b border-neutral-200"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 pr-4">Can I start free?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="text-center mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Software First. Services When You Want Them.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Ecom Circles is built software-first, but managed services live on the same platform when you want to hand off pieces. Use what you need; layer in more as you grow.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Amazon Account Management</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Managed sourcing, listing optimization, repricing strategy, Buy Box recovery, and suspension support. Our team handles the strategy; you see results in your dashboard.</p><a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../services/amazon-management/index.html">How Amazon management works<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Walmart Account Management</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Managed service tuned for Walmart&#x27;s competitive dynamics. Increasingly the primary channel for sellers in our network.</p><a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../services/walmart-management/index.html">How Walmart management works<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Warehouse &amp; Fulfillment</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Receive inventory, prep for FBA or Walmart fulfillment, handle returns, and manage dropship orders. Integrated with the software, not bolted on.</p><a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[#556FE6] hover:underline" href="../services/warehouse/index.html">Warehouse services<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-6">The All-in-One Argument</h2><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Five years ago, the best Amazon sellers used best-of-breed. Twelve tools, each great at one thing. Manual handoffs were tolerable because Amazon was the only marketplace that mattered, and the workflows were predictable.</p><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">That broke when Walmart scaled. Now sourcing has to consider both marketplaces; repricing has to handle different fee structures and competitive dynamics; inventory has to reflect what&#x27;s actually available where. Twelve tools become twenty-four data points to reconcile, and the time you spend reconciling is time you&#x27;re not sourcing or shipping.</p><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">All-in-one isn&#x27;t the trendy option. It&#x27;s the option that lets you scale across channels without burning hours every week on data entry and tool-switching. Ecom Circles was built by sellers who hit that wall and decided the right answer was to merge the toolset, not just add another integration.</p><p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">You can keep buying separate subscriptions and managing the chaos. Or you can pick one platform built for the way you actually sell across Amazon, Walmart, and beyond.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 px-6 bg-neutral-900 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Ready to Replace 5-12 Tools With One?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/60 max-w-xl mx-auto">Stop paying $300-$500/month for tools that don&#x27;t talk to each other. Ecom Circles puts sourcing, repricing, inventory, and orders all in one place.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4"><a href="#features" class="gradient-bg shadow-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white transition hover:opacity-90">Get Started Free<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white/80 transition hover:bg-white/10" href="../pricing/index.html">View Pricing</a></div><div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-white/20 space-y-2"><p class="text-white/70"><a class="font-semibold text-white hover:underline" href="../services/index.html">Explore services</a> if you want hands-off management instead.</p></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$-->
